# The Requiem (jeuno 64), the repop after a wipe: accepted by GM at Prog 1, Popped 1, none of the three up (the char
# wiped, the guardians gone without Yum Kimil's death). The bard's sarcophagus (Sarcophagus+3) pops Yum Kimil and the two
# guardians again (claimed): noAction, no message; a flask traded to it then (Popped 1): nil; a trigger with the three
# up: the pop fails, nil, the script's SARCOPHAGUS_CANNOT_BE_OPENED (7453).
lists TheEldiemeNecropolis/Sarcophagus/onTrigger TheEldiemeNecropolis/Sarcophagus/onTrade
char zone=TheEldiemeNecropolis pos=-417,6.5,500 job=BRD lvl=50
quest Jeuno.TheOldMonument completed
quest Jeuno.AMinstrelInDespair completed
quest Jeuno.PathOfTheBard completed
quest Jeuno.PainfulMemory completed
quest Jeuno.TheRequiem accepted
charvar Quest[3][64]Prog 1
charvar Quest[3][64]Popped 1
item FlaskOfHolyWater
login
trigger Sarcophagus+3                       # Prog 1, Popped 1, none up: the three popped; noAction
trade Sarcophagus+3 FlaskOfHolyWater x1     # Popped 1: nil; nothing
trigger Sarcophagus+3                       # the three up: the pop fails, nil; SARCOPHAGUS_CANNOT_BE_OPENED
